venv/

# Production Run Archive Contract v1
#
# A dated Operational Run (runs/YYYY-MM-DD/) is evidence, not source. It holds
# raw fetched source pages, network request records and the Runtime Security
# Attestation of one nightly run; committing it would push that evidence
# through GitHub and make `git status` dirty for the next Production Preflight
# (which requires a clean work tree).
#
# The durable copy is the sealed, SHA256-manifested archive outside the
# repository -- see docs/production-run-archive.md. Ignoring the run directory
# here is what makes that archive the single retention path, not a second one.
#
# Anchored to daytrade-sbi/runs/ only: the pinned regression fixtures under
# regression/*/runs/ stay tracked.
/runs/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/

# runs/README.md documents the layout and is tracked.
